{"id":"b0cf42030c298d08","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1.md","title":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi 1","display":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1","aliases":["92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1"],"display":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (bounded internal proof formula and induced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> provability formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic strength for the complexity-preserving diagonal construction)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Pi_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Pi_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>公式，所以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li>标准的复杂度保持对角构造可选择一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>固定点</li>\n<li>展开后可读作：不存在编码为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>之证明的自然数</li>\n<li>解释：&quot;对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>不是我的证明&quot;</li>\n<li>原来的全称断言“每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span>见证都属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>”不成立：定义只要求在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价，而可证等价不强迫任意见证具有同一字面或纯逻辑复杂度</li>\n<li>这里断言的是存在一个规范的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>选择；其不可证性仍需相容性等不完备性假设</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"